# FCC seeder extract dumps. seed-files/ and generated/customers.json ARE committed on
# purpose (2026-09-17 decision): production has no FCC DB access and reads these
# committed files instead of extracting live — see fcc-seeder/README.md. They contain
# real customer names/addresses, not just dummy PII, so that decision was made knowingly.
# Only the other generated/ artifacts (schema introspection, id-map — extraction-time-only,
# not read by seed-all.ts) stay out of git.
apps/api/fcc-seeder/generated/*
!apps/api/fcc-seeder/generated/.gitkeep
!apps/api/fcc-seeder/generated/customers.json
*.db
*.db-journal

